     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Jose,<div>That is really a great idea. I accept this invitation and will be happy to share my challenges in genomics analysis using DaRt R, particularly for crop genebank research with you all in this meeting.</div><div>Thanks again for your kind invitation.<br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:medium;margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"color:black;font-size:10pt\">Rajneesh Paliwal, PhD (DAAD\r\nFellow)</span><span style=\"color:black\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">Associate Scientist</span><br></p><p style=\"font-size:medium;margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%;text-align:justify;font-size:12.8px\">Genetic Resources Center</span></p><p style=\"font-size:medium;margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%;text-align:justify;font-size:12.8px\">International Inst. for Tropical\r\nAgriculture</span></p><p style=\"font-size:medium;margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%;text-align:justify;font-size:12.8px\">Oyo Road PMB-5320, Ibadan, Nigeria</span></p></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
